# Internal-only material (docs/GOVERNANCE.md §6C: due diligence reports,
# audit reports, and AI-agent handoff prompts stay out of the public
# repo by default — they read as unflinching about gaps in a way that
# looks like a live vulnerability disclosure without the context of
# what's since been fixed). Files here still exist locally; they're just
# not part of what gets pushed to GitHub.
internal/

# Local-only compose override (docker-compose.yml's own app-service
# comment already documents this convention) — used to temporarily
# expose postgres/redis to the host for real-Postgres integration
# testing (Missão 06) without changing the committed, deliberately
# host-unexposed default.
docker-compose.override.yml
